Login detection uses multiple storage mechanisms: the `wordpress_logged_in` HTTP cookie (server-side check), `wpcom_user_id` in localStorage, `window.currentUser` hydrated by server, and the Redux `isUserLoggedIn` selector checking `currentUser.id`.

