The viewport breakpoints are: at 600px or below the navigation header layout changes, at 781px or below the primary layout gets a card-like appearance with border-radius, and at 782px or above the masterbar shrinks from 46px to 32px and sidebar padding changes.

To summarize the startup process: running `yarn start` triggers the build process (via bin/welcome.js for the ASCII banner, then webpack compilation), and once complete, the server listens on http://calypso.localhost:3000. The "Ready! You can load http://calypso.localhost:3000/ now. Have fun!" message confirms the server is fully ready to serve requests.

No modifications were made to the repository itself. All investigation was performed through grep, sed, and cat commands, along with starting the development server to observe runtime behavior.
